    "instructions": "Slice the smoked tofu thinly.\nAdd to a hot pan with soy sauce, maple, sesame oil, lime, and black pepper. Cook for 3–4 minutes until glossy and caramelised.\nPrep the carrot, cucumber, red cabbage, avocado and herbs.\nMix all peanut sauce ingredients until smooth and creamy.\nDip rice paper into warm water for 5 seconds until soft.\nLayer lettuce, noodles, veg, herbs, avocado, and tofu.\nRoll tightly like a burrito.\nServe with the peanut lime sauce and prepare for maximum crunch.",
